Substitutes now pay: time in a Well app's substitute earns 2 mana a minute (up to 120 a day), and opening it from a block screen earns 10 mana for the first 3 times each day. New: skip a ritual day (planned 24 hours ahead), automatic backup to a folder, quiet hours and a morning-focus gate for Well refill, and "End pact & refund" from the notification. Talisman Lock Mode now lets any of your talismans end a manual session or a ritual without its own talisman. Plus fixes.
